# Milestone: M6 Wave 2
# Covers: T41 inside T38 class body — implicit class receiver.
#
# Class body `get name() { body }` installs the getter on the class
# object directly; instances created via `.new()` inherit the slot
# property through the prototype chain.
#
# Note: the getter body cannot use bare unqualified slot reads to
# resolve against `self` at v0.6.1 (no implicit-this resolver yet);
# the body returns a literal here.

class Counter { get value() { 42 } }; Counter.value
[00000000] 42

class Counter2 { get value() { 99 } }; var c = Counter2.new(); c.value
[00000001] 99
